{"number":67,"audio":"https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/mishari_al_afasy/murattal/67.mp3","verses":[{"n":1,"from":0,"to":10790,"words":[["تَبَـٰرَكَ",0,1040],["ٱلَّذِى",1040,1990],["بِيَدِهِ",1990,2820],["ٱلْمُلْكُ",2820,3760],["وَهُوَ",3760,4250],["عَلَىٰ",4250,4950],["كُلِّ",4950,5550],["شَىْءٍۢ",5550,7280],["قَدِيرٌ",7280,10725]],"translation":"Blessed is He in whose hand is dominion, and He is over all things competent -"},{"n":2,"from":10790,"to":24690,"words":[["ٱلَّذِى",10725,11775],["خَلَقَ",11775,12365],["ٱلْمَوْتَ",12365,13245],["وَٱلْحَيَوٰةَ",13245,14485],["لِيَبْلُوَكُمْ",14485,15855],["أَيُّكُمْ",15855,16945],["أَحْسَنُ",16945,17705],["عَمَلًۭا ۚ",17705,19115],["وَهُوَ",19115,19655],["ٱلْعَزِيزُ",19655,20775],["ٱلْغَفُورُ",20775,24570]],"translation":"[He] who created death and life to test you [as to] which of you is best in deed - and He is the Exalted in Might, the Forgiving -"},{"n":3,"from":24690,"to":43730,"words":[["ٱلَّذِى",24635,25645],["خَلَقَ",25645,26235],["سَبْعَ",26235,26845],["سَمَـٰوَٰتٍۢ",26845,29095],["طِبَاقًۭا ۖ",29095,30325],["مَّا",30325,31235],["تَرَىٰ",31235,31905],["فِى",31905,32325],["خَلْقِ",32325,32975],["ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ",32975,34245],["مِن",34245,35295],["تَفَـٰوُتٍۢ ۖ",35295,36375],["فَٱرْجِعِ",36375,37715],["ٱلْبَصَرَ",37715,38565],["هَلْ",38565,38935],["تَرَىٰ",38935,39595],["مِن",39595,40405],["فُطُورٍۢ",40405,43520]],"translation":"[And] who created seven heavens in layers. You do not see in the creation of the Most Merciful any inconsistency. So return [your] vision [to the sky]; do you see any breaks?"},{"n":4,"from":43730,"to":56630,"words":[["ثُمَّ",43575,45145],["ٱرْجِعِ",45145,45805],["ٱلْبَصَرَ",45805,46675],["كَرَّتَيْنِ",46675,47895],["يَنقَلِبْ",47895,49725],["إِلَيْكَ",49725,50535],["ٱلْبَصَرُ",50535,51305],["خَاسِئًۭا",51305,52165],["وَهُوَ",52165,53585],["حَسِيرٌۭ",53585,56420]],"translation":"Then return [your] vision twice again. [Your] vision will return to you humbled while it is fatigued."},{"n":5,"from":56630,"to":76460,"words":[["وَلَقَدْ",56565,57425],["زَيَّنَّا",57425,59015],["ٱلسَّمَآءَ",59015,61575],["ٱلدُّنْيَا",61575,62745],["بِمَصَـٰبِيحَ",62745,64295],["وَجَعَلْنَـٰهَا",64295,65895],["رُجُومًۭا",65895,66765],["لِّلشَّيَـٰطِينِ ۖ",66765,70465],["وَأَعْتَدْنَا",70465,71875],["لَهُمْ",71875,72385],["عَذَابَ",72385,73125],["ٱلسَّعِيرِ",73125,76340]],"translation":"And We have certainly beautified the nearest heaven with lamps [i.e., stars] and have made [from] them what is thrown at the devils and have prepared for them the punishment of the Blaze."},{"n":6,"from":76460,"to":86910,"words":[["وَلِلَّذِينَ",76405,77795],["كَفَرُوا۟",77795,78675],["بِرَبِّهِمْ",78675,79835],["عَذَابُ",79835,80715],["جَهَنَّمَ ۖ",80715,82445],["وَبِئْسَ",82445,83275],["ٱلْمَصِيرُ",83275,86770]],"translation":"And for those who disbelieved in their Lord is the punishment of Hell, and wretched is the destination."},{"n":7,"from":86910,"to":97800,"words":[["إِذَآ",86825,88855],["أُلْقُوا۟",88855,89665],["فِيهَا",89665,90525],["سَمِعُوا۟",90525,91435],["لَهَا",91435,91975],["شَهِيقًۭا",91975,93945],["وَهِىَ",93945,94465],["تَفُورُ",94465,97670]],"translation":"When they are thrown into it, they hear from it a [dreadful] inhaling while it boils up."},{"n":8,"from":97800,"to":116760,"words":[["تَكَادُ",97755,98625],["تَمَيَّزُ",98625,99705],["مِنَ",99705,100005],["ٱلْغَيْظِ ۖ",100005,103125],["كُلَّمَآ",103125,105444],["أُلْقِىَ",105445,106245],["فِيهَا",106245,107095],["فَوْجٌۭ",107095,108545],["سَأَلَهُمْ",108545,109575],["خَزَنَتُهَآ",109575,112145],["أَلَمْ",112145,112725],["يَأْتِكُمْ",112725,113755],["نَذِيرٌۭ",113755,116650]],"translation":"It almost bursts with rage. Every time a company is thrown into it, its keepers ask them, \"Did there not come to you a warner?\""},{"n":9,"from":116760,"to":137240,"words":[["قَالُوا۟",116685,117475],["بَلَىٰ",117475,118065],["قَدْ",118065,118515],["جَآءَنَا",118515,121005],["نَذِيرٌۭ",121005,122545],["فَكَذَّبْنَا",122545,123995],["وَقُلْنَا",123995,125015],["مَا",125015,125435],["نَزَّلَ",125435,126235],["ٱللَّهُ",126235,127105],["مِن",127105,128245],["شَىْءٍ",128245,129135],["إِنْ",129135,129535],["أَنتُمْ",129535,131115],["إِلَّا",131115,131845],["فِى",131845,132265],["ضَلَـٰلٍۢ",132265,133995],["كَبِيرٍۢ",133995,137100]],"translation":"They will say, \"Yes, a warner had come to us, but we denied and said, 'Allāh has not sent down anything. You are not but in great error.'\""},{"n":10,"from":137240,"to":150090,"words":[["وَقَالُوا۟",137175,138255],["لَوْ",138255,138605],["كُنَّا",138605,140465],["نَسْمَعُ",140465,141215],["أَوْ",141215,141645],["نَعْقِلُ",141645,142425],["مَا",142425,142775],["كُنَّا",142775,144245],["فِىٓ",144245,146025],["أَصْحَـٰبِ",146025,147005],["ٱلسَّعِيرِ",147005,149960]],"translation":"And they will say, \"If only we had been listening or reasoning, we would not be among the companions of the Blaze.\""},{"n":11,"from":150090,"to":159020,"words":[["فَٱعْتَرَفُوا۟",150025,151285],["بِذَنۢبِهِمْ",151285,153275],["فَسُحْقًۭا",153275,154225],["لِّأَصْحَـٰبِ",154225,155545],["ٱلسَّعِيرِ",155545,158890]],"translation":"And they will admit their sin, so [it is] alienation for the companions of the Blaze."},{"n":12,"from":159020,"to":173100,"words":[["إِنَّ",158955,160185],["ٱلَّذِينَ",160185,161165],["يَخْشَوْنَ",161165,162265],["رَبَّهُم",162265,163985],["بِٱلْغَيْبِ",163985,164935],["لَهُم",164935,165575],["مَّغْفِرَةٌۭ",165575,168135],["وَأَجْرٌۭ",168135,169985],["كَبِيرٌۭ",169985,172960]],"translation":"Indeed, those who fear their Lord unseen will have forgiveness and great reward."},{"n":13,"from":173100,"to":186580,"words":[["وَأَسِرُّوا۟",173025,174295],["قَوْلَكُمْ",174295,175275],["أَوِ",175275,175675],["ٱجْهَرُوا۟",175675,176475],["بِهِۦٓ ۖ",176475,178685],["إِنَّهُۥ",178685,180375],["عَلِيمٌۢ",180375,182255],["بِذَاتِ",182255,183045],["ٱلصُّدُورِ",183045,186450]],"translation":"And conceal your speech or publicize it; indeed, He is Knowing of that within the breasts."},{"n":14,"from":186580,"to":193840,"words":[["أَلَا",186525,187225],["يَعْلَمُ",187225,188025],["مَنْ",188025,188295],["خَلَقَ",188295,189085],["وَهُوَ",189085,189545],["ٱللَّطِيفُ",189545,190615],["ٱلْخَبِيرُ",190615,193750]],"translation":"Does He who created not know, while He is the Subtle, the Aware?"},{"n":15,"from":193840,"to":209200,"words":[["هُوَ",206255,208340],["ٱلَّذِى",194145,195025],["جَعَلَ",195025,195665],["لَكُمُ",195665,196085],["ٱلْأَرْضَ",196085,197075],["ذَلُولًۭا",197075,198595],["فَٱمْشُوا۟",198595,199385],["فِى",199385,199815],["مَنَاكِبِهَا",199815,201205],["وَكُلُوا۟",201205,202065],["مِن",202065,202335],["رِّزْقِهِۦ ۖ",202335,203805],["وَإِلَيْهِ",203805,204855],["ٱلنُّشُورُ",204855,206255]],"translation":"It is He who made the earth tame for you - so walk among its slopes and eat of His provision - and to Him is the resurrection."},{"n":16,"from":209200,"to":222990,"words":[["ءَأَمِنتُم",209200,211395],["مَّن",211395,212953],["فِى",212953,213389],["ٱلسَّمَآءِ",213389,215308],["أَن",215308,216338],["يَخْسِفَ",216338,216999],["بِكُمُ",216999,217872],["ٱلْأَرْضَ",217872,218638],["فَإِذَا",218638,219463],["هِىَ",219463,219993],["تَمُورُ",219993,222496]],"translation":"Do you feel secure that He who is above would not cause the earth to swallow you and suddenly it would sway?"},{"n":17,"from":222990,"to":239320,"words":[["أَمْ",222915,223305],["أَمِنتُم",223305,225045],["مَّن",225045,226905],["فِى",226905,227115],["ٱلسَّمَآءِ",227115,229565],["أَن",229565,229865],["يُرْسِلَ",229865,231185],["عَلَيْكُمْ",231185,232195],["حَاصِبًۭا ۖ",232195,234035],["فَسَتَعْلَمُونَ",234035,235575],["كَيْفَ",235575,236235],["نَذِيرِ",236235,239170]],"translation":"Or do you feel secure that He who is above would not send against you a storm of stones? Then you would know how [severe] was My warning."},{"n":18,"from":239320,"to":248800,"words":[["وَلَقَدْ",239245,240085],["كَذَّبَ",240085,240795],["ٱلَّذِينَ",240795,241855],["مِن",241855,243035],["قَبْلِهِمْ",243035,243935],["فَكَيْفَ",243935,244745],["كَانَ",244745,245405],["نَكِيرِ",245405,248660]],"translation":"And already had those before them denied, and how [terrible] was My reproach."},{"n":19,"from":248800,"to":273880,"words":[["أَوَلَمْ",248735,249535],["يَرَوْا۟",249535,250175],["إِلَى",250175,250595],["ٱلطَّيْرِ",250595,251325],["فَوْقَهُمْ",251325,252355],["صَـٰٓفَّـٰتٍۢ",252355,257715],["وَيَقْبِضْنَ ۚ",257715,259465],["مَا",259465,259885],["يُمْسِكُهُنَّ",259885,262055],["إِلَّا",262055,262675],["ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ ۚ",262675,266415],["إِنَّهُۥ",266415,268065],["بِكُلِّ",268065,268865],["شَىْءٍۭ",268865,270065],["بَصِيرٌ",270065,273730]],"translation":"Do they not see the birds above them with wings outspread and [sometimes] folded in? None holds them [aloft] except the Most Merciful. Indeed He is, of all things, Seeing."},{"n":20,"from":273880,"to":293710,"words":[["أَمَّنْ",273795,275275],["هَـٰذَا",275275,275945],["ٱلَّذِى",275945,276755],["هُوَ",276755,277105],["جُندٌۭ",277105,277505],["لَّكُمْ",277506,279355],["يَنصُرُكُم",279355,281295],["مِّن",281295,282605],["دُونِ",282605,283725],["ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ ۚ",283725,286874],["إِنِ",286875,287815],["ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ",287815,289185],["إِلَّا",289185,290065],["فِى",290065,290435],["غُرُورٍ",290435,293570]],"translation":"Or who is it that could be an army for you to aid you other than the Most Merciful? The disbelievers are not but in delusion."},{"n":21,"from":293710,"to":307660,"words":[["أَمَّنْ",293655,295515],["هَـٰذَا",295515,296105],["ٱلَّذِى",296105,297005],["يَرْزُقُكُمْ",297005,298195],["إِنْ",298195,298565],["أَمْسَكَ",298565,299375],["رِزْقَهُۥ ۚ",299375,300695],["بَل",300695,301075],["لَّجُّوا۟",301075,301845],["فِى",301845,302265],["عُتُوٍّۢ",302265,304025],["وَنُفُورٍ",304025,307570]],"translation":"Or who is it that could provide for you if He withheld His provision? But they have persisted in insolence and aversion."},{"n":22,"from":307660,"to":326310,"words":[["أَفَمَن",307625,308375],["يَمْشِى",308375,309835],["مُكِبًّا",309835,310835],["عَلَىٰ",310835,311475],["وَجْهِهِۦٓ",311475,314025],["أَهْدَىٰٓ",314025,316485],["أَمَّن",316485,317725],["يَمْشِى",318495,319195],["سَوِيًّا",319195,320185],["عَلَىٰ",320185,320795],["صِرَٰطٍۢ",320795,321715],["مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ",321715,326180]],"translation":"Then is one who walks fallen on his face better guided or one who walks erect on a straight path?"},{"n":23,"from":326310,"to":341360,"words":[["قُلْ",326215,326635],["هُوَ",326635,326955],["ٱلَّذِىٓ",326955,329155],["أَنشَأَكُمْ",329155,331025],["وَجَعَلَ",331025,331825],["لَكُمُ",331825,332395],["ٱلسَّمْعَ",332395,333285],["وَٱلْأَبْصَـٰرَ",333285,334705],["وَٱلْأَفْـِٔدَةَ ۖ",334705,336035],["قَلِيلًۭا",336035,336845],["مَّا",336845,338135],["تَشْكُرُونَ",338135,341170]],"translation":"Say, \"It is He who has produced you and made for you hearing and vision and hearts [i.e., intellect]; little are you grateful.\""},{"n":24,"from":341360,"to":349040,"words":[["قُلْ",341265,341605],["هُوَ",341605,341955],["ٱلَّذِى",341955,342865],["ذَرَأَكُمْ",342865,343845],["فِى",343845,344095],["ٱلْأَرْضِ",344095,344855],["وَإِلَيْهِ",344855,345855],["تُحْشَرُونَ",345855,348860]],"translation":"Say, \"It is He who has multiplied you throughout the earth, and to Him you will be gathered.\""},{"n":25,"from":349040,"to":358780,"words":[["وَيَقُولُونَ",348955,350445],["مَتَىٰ",350445,351045],["هَـٰذَا",351045,351565],["ٱلْوَعْدُ",351565,352375],["إِن",352375,353425],["كُنتُمْ",353425,354925],["صَـٰدِقِينَ",354925,358610]],"translation":"And they say, \"When is this promise, if you should be truthful?\""},{"n":26,"from":358780,"to":372260,"words":[["قُلْ",358695,359095],["إِنَّمَا",359095,360815],["ٱلْعِلْمُ",360815,361575],["عِندَ",361575,362635],["ٱللَّهِ",362635,363455],["وَإِنَّمَآ",363455,367095],["أَنَا۠",367095,367505],["نَذِيرٌۭ",367505,368315],["مُّبِينٌۭ",368315,372120]],"translation":"Say, \"The knowledge is only with Allāh, and I am only a clear warner.\""},{"n":27,"from":372260,"to":389740,"words":[["فَلَمَّا",372205,373735],["رَأَوْهُ",373735,374535],["زُلْفَةًۭ",374535,376125],["سِيٓـَٔتْ",376125,378615],["وُجُوهُ",378615,379415],["ٱلَّذِينَ",379415,380345],["كَفَرُوا۟",380345,381255],["وَقِيلَ",381255,382105],["هَـٰذَا",382105,382615],["ٱلَّذِى",382615,383385],["كُنتُم",383385,385685],["بِهِۦ",385685,386195],["تَدَّعُونَ",386195,389610]],"translation":"But when they see it approaching, the faces of those who disbelieve will be distressed, and it will be said, \"This is that for which you used to call.\""},{"n":28,"from":389740,"to":410090,"words":[["قُلْ",389665,390075],["أَرَءَيْتُمْ",390075,391215],["إِنْ",391215,391475],["أَهْلَكَنِىَ",391475,392775],["ٱللَّهُ",392775,393595],["وَمَن",393595,394375],["مَّعِىَ",394375,395405],["أَوْ",395405,395675],["رَحِمَنَا",395675,396745],["فَمَن",401985,402345],["يُجِيرُ",403275,403975],["ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ",403975,405465],["مِنْ",405465,405805],["عَذَابٍ",405805,406855],["أَلِيمٍۢ",406855,409960]],"translation":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Have you considered: whether Allāh should cause my death and those with me or have mercy upon us, who can protect the disbelievers from a painful punishment?\""},{"n":29,"from":410090,"to":425710,"words":[["قُلْ",410035,410495],["هُوَ",410495,410815],["ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ",410815,412065],["ءَامَنَّا",412065,413975],["بِهِۦ",413975,414595],["وَعَلَيْهِ",414595,415585],["تَوَكَّلْنَا ۖ",415585,417015],["فَسَتَعْلَمُونَ",417015,419215],["مَنْ",419215,419635],["هُوَ",419635,419905],["فِى",419905,420355],["ضَلَـٰلٍۢ",420355,421145],["مُّبِينٍۢ",421145,425590]],"translation":"Say, \"He is the Most Merciful; we have believed in Him, and upon Him we have relied. And you will [come to] know who it is that is in clear error.\""},{"n":30,"from":425710,"to":444180,"words":[["قُلْ",425645,425935],["أَرَءَيْتُمْ",425935,427115],["إِنْ",427115,427435],["أَصْبَحَ",427435,429495],["مَآؤُكُمْ",429495,431045],["غَوْرًۭا",431045,432415],["فَمَن",432415,432855],["يَأْتِيكُم",432855,435585],["بِمَآءٍۢ",435585,437905],["مَّعِينٍۭ",437905,444060]],"translation":"Say, \"Have you considered: if your water was to become sunken [into the earth], then who could bring you flowing water?\""}]}